                "text_7bLDnd": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "c",
                    "text": "<h4>Functionality</h4><p>The Character Sheets enhance D&D gameplay with a clear, immersive design and a user-friendly, fillable PDF format. Easily record and manage your character’s details directly on your computer or print them in A4 format. To save on ink, opt for the black & white version. After purchase, you'll receive the file via email.</p><p><em>Do not forget to give us your email address in the checkout!</em></p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "center",
                    "type_preset": "custom",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
