                  "settings": {
                    "enable_custom_font": false,
                    "custom_class": "hidden-text-1",
                    "text": "<h4>Overall Features</h4><p>If you’re here, you’ve probably played DnD before. Also, if you’re here, you are probably looking for a great character sheet for your next campaign. Our product contains all the necessary boxes for you to write down your characteristics;  CharacterInformation<strong>, </strong>Ability Scores, Proficiencies and Skills, Combat Information, Attacks and Spellcasting, Equipment, Features and Traits, and Background Details (check photos).</p><h4>Class-Specifc Features</h4><p>To provide you with the highest level of immersion and help you dive deeper into the chosen role, each of our Character Sheets has been created for a specific class. You can feel the uniqness of the designs in the choice of color, background graphic, tailored fields and class-specific ornaments and emblems. Ready for an adventure? </p>",
